name: Illusion — shop cards with enhancements
author: corpus
description: >-
  Illusion makes playing cards bought in the shop sometimes have an Enhancement, Edition,
  or Seal. Tier-2 voucher: requires Magic Trick bought first, so the earliest practical target
  is Ante 2. RAG aliases: buy enhanced cards, shop deck fixing, Hologram fuel, Vampire food.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Illusion
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - voucher: MagicTrick
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Hologram
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Vampire
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
